{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39579","headline":"文明殿受册封闽王 · 翁承赞","name":"文明殿受册封闽王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙墀班听漏声长，竹帛昭勳扑御香。\n鸣佩洞庭辞帝主，登车故里册闽王。\n一千年改江山瑞，十万军蒙雨露光。\n吟寄短篇追往事，留文功业不寻常。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}